  "scored_prediction": "The additive modification to the objective function introduces a term that encourages embedding vectors to align with predefined concepts. It does this by assigning a larger cost to vectors that do not align well with the concept, while leaving the cost unchanged for vectors that do align. This modification is designed to improve the interpretability of the word embeddings.",
